{"lemma":"נָצַח","translit":"na.tsach","gloss":"to conduct","tbesh_subentries":[],"tbesh_html":"1) to excel, be bright, be preeminent, be perpetual, be overseer, be enduring<br>1a) (Niphal) enduring (participle)<br>1b) (Piel) to act as overseer or superintendent or director or chief<BR>Aramaic equivalent: <i>ne.tsach</i> (נְצַח \"to distinguish oneself\" H5330)","tbesh_key":"H5329","strongs_1890":{"strongs_def":"properly, to glitter from afar, i.e. to be eminent (as a superintendent, especially of the Temple services and its music); to be permanent","derivation":"a primitive root;  also as denominative from H5331 (נֶצַח)","kjv_def":"excel, chief musician (singer), oversee(-r), set forward."},"count":65,"occurrences":[["1Ch.15.21",1],["1Ch.23.4",1],["2Ch.2.2",1],["2Ch.2.18",1],["2Ch.34.12",1],["2Ch.34.13",1],["Ezr.3.8",1],["Ezr.3.9",1],["Psa.4.0",1,null,null],["Psa.5.0",1,null,null],["Psa.6.0",1,null,null],["Psa.8.0",1,null,null],["Psa.9.0",1,null,null],["Psa.11.0",1,null,null],["Psa.12.0",1,null,null],["Psa.13.0",1,null,null],["Psa.14.0",1,null,null],["Psa.18.0",1,null,null],["Psa.19.0",1,null,null],["Psa.20.0",1,null,null],["Psa.21.0",1,null,null],["Psa.22.0",1,null,null],["Psa.31.0",1,null,null],["Psa.36.0",1,null,null],["Psa.39.0",1,null,null],["Psa.40.0",1,null,null],["Psa.41.0",1,null,null],["Psa.42.0",1,null,null],["Psa.44.0",1,null,null],["Psa.45.0",1,null,null],["Psa.46.0",1,null,null],["Psa.47.0",1,null,null],["Psa.49.0",1,null,null],["Psa.51.0",1,null,null],["Psa.52.0",1,null,null],["Psa.53.0",1,null,null],["Psa.54.0",1,null,null],["Psa.55.0",1,null,null],["Psa.56.0",1,null,null],["Psa.57.0",1,null,null],["Psa.58.0",1,null,null],["Psa.59.0",1,null,null],["Psa.60.0",1,null,null],["Psa.61.0",1,null,null],["Psa.62.0",1,null,null],["Psa.64.0",1,null,null],["Psa.65.0",1,null,null],["Psa.66.0",1,null,null],["Psa.67.0",1,null,null],["Psa.68.0",1,null,null],["Psa.69.0",1,null,null],["Psa.70.0",1,null,null],["Psa.75.0",1,null,null],["Psa.76.0",1,null,null],["Psa.77